sequenceDiagram
    participant T1 as Job thread 1
    participant T2 as Job thread 2
    participant T3 as Job thread 3
    participant C as BamTokenCache
    participant B as BAM
    Note over T1,C: The token just went stale and three jobs need it in the same millisecond
    par
        T1->>C: getCredentials()
    and
        T2->>C: getCredentials()
    and
        T3->>C: getCredentials()
    end
    critical T1 wins refreshLock
        C->>+B: GET token · exactly one call
        B-->>-C: bamToken
    option T2 and T3 park on the lock
        C->>C: wait at most refresh-wait-timeout (15 s)
    end
    C-->>T1: fresh headers
    C-->>T2: same token · double-check hit
    C-->>T3: same token · double-check hit
    Note over T1,B: Had the fetch failed, T2 and T3 get a copy of the same failure instead of a second BAM call
